  "details": "I think VRChat desperately needs some sort of age verification. The game may not be intended to be mature in nature, but there are NSFW/18+ avatars, experiences and groups and those will always be a thing. My idea is that until your age is verified through sending in your ID, mature content should automatically be blocked. If VRChat is going to be 13+, we need to have these requirements in place.",
